# Cloud captures and the map used to pseudonymise them. A raw capture from the
# NaviLink cloud carries your MAC address, your home's street address and
# coordinates, your account's name and the tokens for your session. The map is a
# list of them. Only pseudonymised fixtures belong in tests/fixtures/.
# See scripts/README.md.
tests/fixtures/raw/
*.map.json

# Never commit a credential file. The scripts read the account from the
# environment or prompt for it; neither writes one, but a hand-made one here
# would be one keystroke from a public repository.
.navilink-credentials.json
